T3.3 -- the 3x3 special case priced against the general row kernel
================================================================================

Both columns are ops/morphology.hpp. `auto` is what bincv::erode and
bincv::dilate call; `generic` is impl::MorphPath::Generic, the same kernel
with the 3x3 special case refused. A ratio > 1 is what the special case saves.
The two are required to compute the same image before either is timed.

